The contents of custom_components/ecovacs_goat/ are derived from
homeassistant/components/ecovacs/ at tag 2026.8.2. Changes made in this fork:

  * The integration domain was renamed from "ecovacs" to "ecovacs_goat" so it
    runs independently of, and alongside, the official integration.
  * The legacy XMPP code path was removed, along with the py-sucks dependency
    and the vacuum platform, since GOAT mowers speak JSON over MQTT.
  * Zone control was added (zone.py, zone_api.py): per-zone mowing parameters
    and starting individual zones. These commands are not part of
    deebot-client; they were derived from a recording of the GOAT protocol.
  * A runtime registration for device classes that deebot-client does not know
    yet was added (registry.py).

